<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We know that life’s seed is growing indeed</l><l>When fruits of life are expressed</l><l>Such as virtues of joy, peace, faithfulness, love.</l><l>Does my daily life pass the test?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When these virtues show others surely will know</l><l>The beauty of life will shine,</l><l>And the gospel word of life will be heard</l><l>Bringing many to know life divine!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord grant me today, a new start in this way.</l><l>A person of life I would be—</l><l>Just expressing You in all that I do.</l><l>Oh may this life flow out of me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
